  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tourism, long-term research, and conservation of western gorillas in Loango National Park, Gabon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) monitoring the impact of tourism on a habituated gorilla group and on non-habituated gorillas; 2) continuing habituation of a second gorilla group; 3) conducting long-term gorilla behavioral ecology research; 4) coordinating with the Gabonese wildlife authority (ANPN) on management, surveillance for illegal activities, and development of educational materials for tourism; and 5) strengthening national capacity for science-based conservation and adaptive management by training Gabonese staff.</narrative>
  </description>
